            "review_text": "zStacyP\nNha Trang, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nBest panini ever\nMar 2026 • Family\nSuch a relief to have a good-quality panini while traveling. We had the Parma and Bologna paninis, and both were absolutely delicious. The juices were also great, with no added sugar by default, which I really appreciated.\n\nThe place is literally right in the center of Nha Trang, so it’s hard to miss. It also looks like they have live music upstairs on weekends, which seems like a nice bonus.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 1, 2026",
