            "review_text": "Marianne R\nMelbourne, Australia2 contributions\n0\nAmazing Service and Food\nOct 2025 • Solo\nI visited Bottega 26 on a number of occasions on my visit to Nha Trang.\nMy brother is now a local and this is one of his favourite places to eat, and I can understand why.\nLots of items on the menu to choose from at any time of day.\nFood is amazing, especially the panini!\nGreat choices for vegetarians and vegan diets as well.\nHighly recommend for breakfast or dinner.\nManager is a delightful lady who goes out of her way to ensure patrons are very well looked after.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 11, 2025",
