            "review_text": "Oscardog16\nAdelaide, Australia3348 contributions\n0\nOur two pasta meals were average.\nSep 2025 • Couples\nWe shared Gnocchi Bolognese. The house made gnocchi was ok. The sauce was plentiful to coat the pasta. It had a slightly sweet taste maybe from carrot. \nAlso shared Fettuccini with a creamy sauce containing sausage and mushroom. The sauce was very bland, so we mixed a lot of the bolognaise sauce into it to make a rose sauce. This was a huge improvement. The house made Fettuccini was very good. Both serves were the large portions. We struggled to eat it, so maybe 1 large and 1 small serve may have been enough. \nUnfortunately, they have very loud music thumping away in the casual dining area. Overall, it was edible, but we wouldn’t return.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nBring earplugs\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 7, 2025",
